  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MATRIZ II: Strengthening the Value of Migrant Associations in Spain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening the network of diaspora associations in Spain and fostering their active participation in the Spanish society by delivering training sessions on project management, implementation and reporting. During the second phase of the project, IOM will work towards strengthening the relations of diaspora associations in southern European societies.</narrative>
  </description>
